; Room 9 ($09): On a Branch Over the Drive
;
; Format: see #R$C000.
; .
; Border: red (2). Conveyor: none. Ramp: 4 cells from row 10 column 14 up to
; row 7 column 17, rising to the right.
; .
; Items (from the item table at #R$A400): 1, at row 11 column 5.
; .
; Exits: left Room 10 (The Front Door, #R$CA00); right Room 8 (Inside the
; MegaTrunk, #R$C800); up Room 13 (Out on a limb, #R$CD00); down Room 4 (The
; Drive, #R$C400). Odd: the up exit of Room 4 is Room 6, not this room.
; .
; Entities: slot 0: definition $09 (at $A048) start $1E; slot 1: definition
; $1B (at $A0D8) start $87; slot 2: definition $3D (at $A1E8) start $13; slot
; 3: definition $3E (at $A1F0) start $0E; slot 4: definition $3C (at $A1E0)
; start $44. List ends at slot 5 ($FF).
